data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","sequence_number":97,"output_index":0,"item":{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_098a498fffced0a1016ac95438b53c81968f0fd2b7ac5a5581","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Managing testing efficiently**\n\nI’m considering the 7k token budget. I have plenty left, but I want to minimize usage. I plan to add a VM test harness to the existing tests to streamline the new test extracts script. This will allow it to get server HTML using the same fixture. It’s all about confirming checks with a mocked form data browser. I'll make sure it can loop through true and false, and assert controls are as expected. Sounds good for regression testing!"}],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABqyVQ7QXh9Gp25dJ_w2GQRCcgqcB0x08Qj7l2DFYfCp1nH5yoMJB_tgQKD3-qiANWOaISxvDU8ULQViEHkeFgp2n9c3C-f7TYXG56kD_s0nMl_WqsOBmFmNNTyOIKfm2yznZUajGzhI_cF2qwUsR84funi_hrWlf5E2vqxJTVAHxw4Skv_VjvlFvGmfUBpz-IAn4rg9H2Ms9qJLbgCjriHz8E7Y0urwtUR-ImbXbmsVjAsr3eokR7-KoDSFwNRL2Pl9670Q9-qCY3Ezc-FlFNlPDDYjSnL1WT5FL3Bly_5qPSbiDBbfbfWyxG9ulhUsDuUGCbqpXttHXS7laSFiyOK8WZvsv7FZxjOkoD9ME5kX4ZDyBfm5olK5Gf-J4oNpfMQSR2pgIjeEhnOVsu2Vzc3NwJXJy_ynvVrHnshj01SkP4iRtOOatVPd2l29AYdYxjtJrAmBYuXSg1BVpC67BzTUjm-Hcn8gJd3UYbw3Ghip4HfFlVGGGrFc7kcKA_agi3X3SfXOhf9RmYECsLmrDN-381zVQh5WiCl7_xgM5HwmEMPAigBD8uy4kytFtQIOth0eNpBm2JcPdPmUmYenQxicJ_fFxo-Bw0Tv0-XzIZZhG6hTJ7XTaOb-DEv5wGWgg2HJdl2JOpU_TC9kAuOQj1OlVQHkzc4i2ZB5IWIGYzNDRIwbKDcXBAHH_xMAjqIG7uCtNaHSc-WxTc3qJINLbTpYI17o1l7s28P4MAS-WnPm85iUtGxTe_vrsFpfpji6FfXssM5-F45zk9nv8gnvzIbqJwUmqgfXkwTCPFRTC6PIkqnifTvQ0eb-22oHinf1p98k3yhwLi1Hfzx2zKxGtySVpDrTrtK6mYnUvlK0UHtnfIfOZtJIdClUkObU3OnXB2uRHj86o_welhyZCury2m9yE4TUMkwm3iyf_ErZftpIO55zgyHQhEKZK9qF7-QcC8Ks5kzfvfIbcxdhrK4cpf30V5xJGv4Rje4P-huBOSrJQ-lixlZOJ311GtAawBHSrahc9bCgb8CrgV1N_kUzCqQstFILc_BlqsNcbGEphRo5HPThRbj0CeFeCN73tnsdbrECFQ27W5ohgcDwTIY5ABFoxImlIz0LNkhAbj7UJKHYMhkRz11uiup9lxaKhOikPl09oJeFLiW_peAJwuIr3dXhc_IMcv0527Qy3ExJMZTGstyzT91y1HNWYQVLxf6s4sna77ghLElbYptfnDJySbbWLKMSGpIzv2yUNL1l4eZjk3dfOwK1unU3Hiw